Package: arenaveg
Title: Explore the FAWF Vegetation Survey (Open Foris Arena) on a Map
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "swburnafterreading2025@gmail.com")
Description: Shiny app (golem) for the regeneration and ground vegetation
    survey (Arena surveys 31 and 33): plots, regeneration circles and patches
    on a map, extended ground cover, regeneration and droppings per circle,
    a photo gallery and a completeness check per plot and year.
